remove the "smart shuffle" feature.

"Random odrder" mode will be with weighted 100 last viewed pictures, and no smart in name.

default weight for unseen/out-of-list picture: 1

keep a weight for last 100 displayed pictures: 
  - last picture : 0.01 
  - 2nd last pic:  0.02, 
  - etc until 
  - last 99 picture shown: weight: 0.99
  
(if two pictures were shown because of split mode, add them both in the list, no matter if they have 0.01 weight difference)

other display mode order in the list will be:
- by exif time (fallback to timestamp of creation file if no exif time found).
- by timestamp of creation time of file
- by timestamp of modification time of file

if android does not support separate create/modif timestamp, just use one.
